## 🧠 Nature of Work (What You Actually Do)

### Work Breakdown
```
Research & Strategy: 55%  ████████████░░░░░░░░
Architecture:        17%  ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
Development:         11%  ███░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
Orchestration:       17%  ████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░
```

### Insight
> **You spend more time THINKING than CODING.**

This is typical for a solo founder in early stage:
- Research competitors, markets, validation pathways
- Define strategy and roadmap
- Architecture and specs
- Actual coding is a smaller percentage

