## 🤖 Model Fit by Task Type

| Task Type | Best Model | Why |
|:----------|:-----------|:----|
| **Research** | Gemini 2.5 Pro | Fast, good at summarization, free tier |
| **Strategy** | Opus 4.5 | Deep thinking, nuanced reasoning |
| **Architecture** | Opus 4.5 | Complex decisions, trade-offs |
| **Coding** | Opus 4.5 | Best code quality |
| **Review/Critic** | Opus 4.5 | Careful analysis needed |
| **Digest/Summary** | Gemini 2.5 | Fast, routine |

