---

## 🎯 Implications

### For Internal Workflow
1. **Offload research to Gemini CLI** — Frees up 55% of Opus quota
2. **Automate digests** — Another 10% freed
3. **Reserve Opus for deep work** — Strategy, architecture, coding

### For Public MCP Roadmap
1. **Your users likely have same pattern** — More research than coding
2. **Templates should reflect this** — `researcher` template may be most popular
3. **Multi-model routing** — Could be a Phase C feature for Nucleus Pro

---

## ✅ Summary

| Observation | Implication |
|:------------|:------------|
| 55% of work is research | Build Gemini CLI daemon for background research |
| Opus used for everything | Wasting quota on simple tasks |
| No parallelism | You're blocked waiting for research |
| Critic agent unused | Add review checkpoints |
